        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "Explain how you know whether a number is rational.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "It can be written as $\\frac{a}{b}$, where $a$ and $b$ are integers and $b\\ne0$.",
          "worked": "A number is rational if it can be written as $\\frac{a}{b}$, where $a$ and $b$ are integers and $b\\ne0$. Its decimal representation terminates or recurs.",
